<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Ocurest Lab 1.2 mln at $4/shr.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Ocurest Lab 1.2 mln at $4/shr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	 Ocurest Laboratories Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $4</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		     4-5</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			  1.2 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	   RAF Financial Corp</p>
<p>The number of shares was lowered from 2 million.</p>
<p>The Florida-based company manufactures eyedrops dispensers.</p>
